            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A case of heparin-induced skin reaction at the sites of subcutaneous injections is reported. The clinical details of 15 previously reported cases are summarized, and the importance of recognizing this complication is discussed.</AbstractText>
